## Skill: playwright

**Base directory**: /mnt/dados/projetos/doom test

# Playwright Browser Automation

This skill provides browser automation capabilities via the Playwright MCP server.

## Available MCP Servers

### playwright

**Tools:**

#### `browser_close`
Close the page

**inputSchema:**
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {},
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

#### `browser_resize`
Resize the browser window

**inputSchema:**
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "width": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Width of the browser window"
    },
    "height": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Height of the browser window"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "width",
    "height"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

#### `browser_console_messages`
Returns all console messages

**inputSchema:**
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "level": {
      "default": "info",
      "description": "Level of the console messages to return. Each level includes the messages of more severe levels. Defaults to \"info\".",
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "error",
        "warning",
        "info",
        "debug"
      ]
    },
    "all": {
      "description": "Return all console messages since the beginning of the session, not just since the last navigation. Defaults to false.",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "filename": {
      "description": "Filename to save the console messages to. If not provided, messages are returned as text.",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "level"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

